# Real fix for the disk-space exhaustion that kept recurring all
# session: with no .dockerignore, every `docker build` sent every
# crate's local target/ (gigabytes of host build artifacts - debug
# builds, incremental compilation caches) as build context, and COPY
# instructions that copy a whole crate directory (see the Dockerfiles)
# copied them straight into the image/build layers too. None of this
# was ever needed - every Dockerfile does its own `cargo build` inside
# the container from source.
target/
**/target/
.git/
os-image/binaries/
os-image/output/
os-image/cache/
**/*.iso
